      "content": "hey, idk if i'm just losing it or something but i've been seeing some really weird stuff lately. like, yesterday i saw the exact same guy in a red jacket walk past my window, then like 5 mins later he's walking past again in the exact same way. it's like a loop or something. and i've been getting these weird feeling of dejavu so intense it feels like the world is stuttering. do u ever get like... glitches in the data or something? like, does the world ever feel unstable to u?",
